    "detailed_description": "<strong>Defenders of the West</strong> is a classic tower defense game set in the <strong>wild west</strong>. It adds some unique twists to the classic genre and will appeal to players of all skill levels. <br>A large gang of bandits has organized into a small army. The old Marshall Robert B. Gun has enlisted you and some of his old friends to stop them.<br>The unique setting, beautiful, hand crafted environments, dynamic levels and a cool story with a pinch of humor set this game apart from other tower defense games.<br>A wide variety of enemies, towers with at least 3 upgrades each, perks and abilities combined with three levels of difficulty offer high replayability.<br>Set up your towers and watch the carnage unfold with a rotatable and zoom- able camera! Show those bandits what it means to be a Defender of the West!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289170/extras/3794c18131a3cc8a3fd64ece7bf125cf.avif?t=1615524138\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Defenders of the West</strong> is a classic tower defense game set in the <strong>wild west</strong>. It adds some unique twists to the classic genre and will appeal to players of all skill levels. <br>A large gang of bandits has organized into a small army. The old Marshall Robert B. Gun has enlisted you and some of his old friends to stop them.<br>The unique setting, beautiful, hand crafted environments, dynamic levels and a cool story with a pinch of humor set this game apart from other tower defense games.<br>A wide variety of enemies, towers with at least 3 upgrades each, perks and abilities combined with three levels of difficulty offer high replayability.<br>Set up your towers and watch the carnage unfold with a rotatable and zoom- able camera! Show those bandits what it means to be a Defender of the West!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289170/extras/3794c18131a3cc8a3fd64ece7bf125cf.avif?t=1615524138\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Defenders of the West is a tower defense game set in the wild west that adds a few unique twists to the classic genre. Defend the west against a large group of bandits! Enjoy the unique setting, beautiful, hand crafted environments, dynamic levels and a cool story with a pinch of humor!",
